  97:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      [..]
  98:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        Below the list of most used macros in SMBUS HAL driver.
  99:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c **** 
 100:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****       (+) __HAL_SMBUS_ENABLE:      Enable the SMBUS peripheral
 101:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****       (+) __HAL_SMBUS_DISABLE:     Disable the SMBUS peripheral
 102:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****       (+) __HAL_SMBUS_GET_FLAG:    Check whether the specified SMBUS flag is set or not
 103:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****       (+) __HAL_SMBUS_CLEAR_FLAG:  Clear the specified SMBUS pending flag
 104:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****       (+) __HAL_SMBUS_ENABLE_IT:   Enable the specified SMBUS interrupt
 105:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****       (+) __HAL_SMBUS_DISABLE_IT:  Disable the specified SMBUS interrupt
 106:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c **** 
 107:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      *** Callback registration ***
 108:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      =============================================
 109:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****     [..]
 110:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      The compilation flag USE_HAL_SMBUS_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
 111:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 112:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      Use Functions HAL_SMBUS_RegisterCallback() or HAL_SMBUS_RegisterAddrCallback()
 113:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      to register an interrupt callback.
 114:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****     [..]
 115:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      Function HAL_SMBUS_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 116:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) MasterTxCpltCallback : callback for Master transmission end of transfer.
 117:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) MasterRxCpltCallback : callback for Master reception end of transfer.
 118:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) SlaveTxCpltCallback  : callback for Slave transmission end of transfer.
 119:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) SlaveRxCpltCallback  : callback for Slave reception end of transfer.
 120:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) ListenCpltCallback   : callback for end of listen mode.
 121:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback        : callback for error detection.
 122:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) MspInitCallback      : callback for Msp Init.
 123:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) MspDeInitCallback    : callback for Msp DeInit.
 124:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 125:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      and a pointer to the user callback function.
 126:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****     [..]
 127:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      For specific callback AddrCallback use dedicated register callbacks : HAL_SMBUS_RegisterAddrCa
 128:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****     [..]
 129:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      Use function HAL_SMBUS_UnRegisterCallback to reset a callback to the default
 130:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      weak function.
 131:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      HAL_SMBUS_UnRegisterCallback takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 132:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      and the Callback ID.
 133:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      This function allows to reset following callbacks:
 134:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) MasterTxCpltCallback : callback for Master transmission end of transfer.
 135:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) MasterRxCpltCallback : callback for Master reception end of transfer.
 136:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) SlaveTxCpltCallback  : callback for Slave transmission end of transfer.
 137:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) SlaveRxCpltCallback  : callback for Slave reception end of transfer.
 138:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) ListenCpltCallback   : callback for end of listen mode.
 139:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback        : callback for error detection.
