 150:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 151:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_smbus.c ****      If MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the HAL_SMBUS_Init()/ HAL_SMBUS_DeInit()
